  14: - The static metric is \(ds^2=-a^2c^2dt^2+B^2dr^2+r^2d\Omega^2\). The optical coordinate is \(x=-\int_r^{R_d}(B/a)\,dr\), and \(\Psi=r\,\delta\varphi\).
