  17: The background is a static weak-field model with a helium core and a hydrogen-rich envelope (\(X\simeq0.89\)). It has \(M_i=0.198\,M_\odot\), \(R=6.91\times10^9\) cm, \(T_{\rm eff}=15{,}898\) K and \(\log g=5.740\), with a gray Eddington envelope built with Rosseland tables. Its scalar profile \(\varphi_0(r)\) has asymptotic value \(\varphi_\infty=10^{-3}\), which is a linearization point.
